# Forbidden client-specific names (local configuration)
#
# This file demonstrates the pattern for .forbidden_names (gitignored).
# Copy this to .forbidden_names and add actual client names (one per line).
#
# Purpose: Block client-specific naming from being committed.
# The pre-commit hook reads .forbidden_names and blocks any matches.
#
# Example (do not use real names in this tracked file):
# exampleclient
# anotherclient
